er new skills and use them to outsmart your enemies or you'll end up dead in the gutter in no time. Will you become a mean and ruthless bounty hunter or a kind and eloquent friend of colonists and natives? It’s up to you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/531660/extras/92db29cbaa00e16e292b3c7bd9a5c17d.poster.avif?t=1782406533\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/531660/extras/92db29cbaa00e16e292b3c7bd9a5c17d.webm?t=1782406533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/531660/extras/92db29cbaa00e16e292b3c7bd9a5c17d.mp4?t=1782406533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "short_description": "Build your path in this alien world. Do a dirty job for food or become the one who makes calls. Sometimes the right word makes a bigger impact than a big gun. Explore local culture and mysteries, and discover the harsh yet beautiful nature in this handcrafted singleplayer action RPG.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/531660/header.jpg?t=1782406533", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/531660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782406533", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/531660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782406533", "website": "https://exoplanetgame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4690 / AMD FX 4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GPU GeForce GTX 680 / AMD GPU Radeon R9 280X<br>